00:23:52,780 --> 00:23:54,600
that we need more
things like this,

553
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:57,130
is really one of the
most important things,

554
00:23:57,130 --> 00:24:01,110
is we need more human
data in the open.

555
00:24:01,110 --> 00:24:02,760
And this is a quick aside.

556
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:04,930
It's kind of out of
the flow of the talk.

557
00:24:04,930 --> 00:24:07,710
But on April 28 of 2023--

558
00:24:07,710 --> 00:24:11,160
typo on the slide-- of April
28 of 2023, stable Vicuna

559
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:15,360
was released from
CarperAI, which looks now

560
00:24:15,360 --> 00:24:17,700
like the style of
training models,

