751
00:32:51,790 --> 00:32:52,870
That's way too expensive.

752
00:32:52,870 --> 00:32:55,950
We need something that you
could sit down as an engineer

753
00:32:55,950 --> 00:32:59,730
and get feedback in
10 to 15 minutes.

754
00:32:59,730 --> 00:33:01,570
So I run through these in order.

755
00:33:01,570 --> 00:33:03,840
And a lot of these
are obvious, but it's

756
00:33:03,840 --> 00:33:06,000
important to take this
from the perspective of,

757
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:09,210
what can I use when I'm
trying to align models?

758
00:33:09,210 --> 00:33:11,190
And what is an
immediate feedback

759
00:33:11,190 --> 00:33:14,030
versus what is this
long-term signal?

760
00:33:14,030 --> 00:33:17,560
So ChatBotArena is
obviously fantastic.

761
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:20,160
Like, everyone looks at
this today as something

762
00:33:20,160 --> 00:33:23,070
that is defining--

763
00:33:23,070 --> 00:33:25,800
it's like defining
