853
00:37:39,700 --> 00:37:41,790
But we don't have
this clear indicator

854
00:37:41,790 --> 00:37:44,630
in alignment evaluation.

855
00:37:44,630 --> 00:37:48,110
The Open LLM Leaderboard
was the same, where it's--

856
00:37:48,110 --> 00:37:50,660
this came out of the team I
was working on at Hugging Face,

857
00:37:50,660 --> 00:37:53,930
where we were just trying
to evaluate more models

858
00:37:53,930 --> 00:37:56,907
