00:39:48,080 --> 00:39:51,560
I think we're getting
good questions in the chat

904
00:39:51,560 --> 00:39:55,190
around RLHF and other things.

905
00:39:55,190 --> 00:39:58,070
To what extent are-- do
aligned models actually

906
00:39:58,070 --> 00:40:01,670
reason about whether
user intent is malicious

907
00:40:01,670 --> 00:40:04,280
rather than perform target
detection to detect--

908
00:40:04,280 --> 00:40:06,000
to avoid unsafe topics?

909
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:08,360
This is a question
that I wanted to read

910
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:11,880
because it gets at this
model versus system topic.

911
00:40:11,880 --> 00:40:14,540
So when ChatGPT was
released on day one,

912
00:40:14,540 --> 00:40:17,540
it has an output filter
that does moderation.

913
00:40:17,540 --> 00:40:20,320
The language model that is
