931
00:41:09,270 --> 00:41:13,470

932
00:41:13,470 --> 00:41:16,590
So this chapter is when I
started to get validation

933
00:41:16,590 --> 00:41:20,520
as an RL researcher that
being opportunistic and going

934
00:41:20,520 --> 00:41:23,760
to work in language models
was actually a good idea.

