1061
00:46:47,530 --> 00:46:49,400
People are using all
sorts of crazy things,

1062
00:46:49,400 --> 00:46:51,380
so it just felt
really good to use.

1063
00:46:51,380 --> 00:46:53,300
It was building on
this better base model.

1064
00:46:53,300 --> 00:46:54,520
Mistral had come out.

1065
00:46:54,520 --> 00:46:56,950
And new data set, this
UltraFeedback data

1066
00:46:56,950 --> 00:46:58,450
set that I mentioned
is still one

1067
00:46:58,450 --> 00:47:02,690
